{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlglyph\/value"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"value","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLGlyphV5valueSSvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGlyph"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGlyph\/value"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLGlyph":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlglyph","title":"MXLGlyph","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLGlyph","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The glyph element represents what SMuFL glyph should be used for different variations of symbols that are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"semantically identical. The type attribute specifies what type of glyph is being defined. The element value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies what SMuFL glyph to use, including recommended stylistic alternates. The SMuFL glyph name should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"match the type. For instance, a type of quarter-rest would use values restQuarter, restQuarterOld, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restQuarterZ. A type of g-clef-ottava-bassa would use values gClef8vb, gClef8vbOld, or gClef8vbCClef. A type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of octave-shift-up-8 would use values ottava, ottavaBassa, ottavaBassaBa, ottavaBassaVb, or octaveBassa."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLGlyph","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGlyph","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLGlyph/value":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlglyph\/value","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGlyph\/value","type":"topic","title":"value","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]}}}